<!--
  Only genuinely public, indexable pages belong here.

  Excluded on purpose:
  - /faq and the rest of the app shell: routes/_app.tsx sends unauthenticated
    visitors to /login, so they are not viewable by a crawler.
  - /signup/:inviteSlug, /events/:eventId, /fund/:slug and friends: per-record
    URLs with no stable list to enumerate.
  - /demo/*: a mock world, not the product.

  Communities are listed by hand: add /communities/<slug> when one opens
  publicly (its page sets its own title, description and canonical).
-->
